WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.310
Is the room well-lit? Really?

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:07.440
Honestly and truly? Make sure it's
nice and bright while you're watching!

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:33.340
Goodbye, Sensei!

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:47.020
I could swear she was crying...

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:18.920
I Cuddled up with Him!
First Experience!?

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:22.200
First Experience!? I Cuddled up with Him!
I Cuddled up with Him!
First Experience!?

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.120
I Cuddled up with Him!
First Experience!?

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:31.730
Huh? Mom?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.290
Your popularity with the girls
is really helpful.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.620
So... who's making breakfast?

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:45.280
Good morning!

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:48.090
Huh? What's wrong, Darling?

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:50.010
Next comes...

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.590
Ah, #2!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.680
Ah! G-Good morning...

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:59.040
She says she's going to come over and make breakfast for you every day.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.010
That sure saves me a lot of work!

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.660
I want to help, too!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.410
Get serious!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.580
That's just messed up!
She's not even part of our family!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.320
No, she <i>is</i>  family!

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:14.110
She may not look anything like me,
but she is definitely part of the family!

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.620
She is my true daughter!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:19.280
So that's the reason!
So that's the reason!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.080
So <i>that's</i>  why that girl
has been here all morning!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.820
I'm glad we got that straightened out.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.330
Yeah, yeah, that's just great...

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:30.050
Wow!

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.380
Incredible!

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.090
At any rate, I cannot guarantee that she...

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:38.110
...will not remove her glasses and cause trouble again in the future.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:41.720
But to me, she is my one and only precious daughter!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:45.940
I want her to be at my side forever,
so I can protect her from all harm!

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:49.730
Therefore, she will be living
next door to us, starting today!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.550
Now I get it!

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:57.270
I hope you can accept me as your neighbor.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.650
What's your sign?

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:00.620
Gemini. And you?

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:01.870
Me? Hmm...

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:01.880
Don't act so friendly!
Me? Hmm...

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.410
Don't act so friendly!

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:06.600
Hey, isn't this actually increasing the risk?

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:09.430
I agree with him.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.250
Indeed.

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.270
Anyway, I'm jealous...

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.130
Less pining, more eating.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:16.000
Thank you for the food!

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.510
You're going to eat?!

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:20.260
"Self-Study"

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.560
Apparently, Ihata-sensei has suddenly fallen ill.
"Self-Study"

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:27.950
She said that we all should
study hard for finals and stuff.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:31.340
Eh? But she seemed so healthy yesterday.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.510
You're right...

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:36.650
Natsumi-sensei has always been proud of her perfect work attendance record, too.

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:51.420
That fool...

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:55.380
Today's studying is done!

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:57.140
Let's go home together, Dar-ling?

00:04:57.140 --> 00:04:59.800
Huh? Darling?

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:06.570
Let's see, when Iwaki-kun comes out...

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.020
First, I'll call out his name.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:10.700
And then say, "Hey, funny seeing you here!"

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.130
Then, "Now that we're neighbors, why don't we go home together?"

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:19.160
I could have sworn that Iwaki-kun was here just now.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.650
Huh? #2!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:24.700
Funny meeting you here!

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.540
Ah, yes...

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.960
Now that we're neighbors,
wanna go home together?

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:32.420
My husband already took off.
Mean guy, isn't he?

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:34.420
Then that <i>was</i>  him just now.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.640
Go away! I hate you!

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:48.680
Hey!

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.390
Iwaki-kun?

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.560
Dinner's ready!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.310
I'm finished too!

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:33.950
Huh? Where's my husband?

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.390
I called him, but...

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:35.710
Well then, I'll-

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.230
I'll go get him!
Well then, I'll-

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:41.660
I knew it. I need to be bolder...

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.950
WAIT, KYOUKO!!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:47.370
You're quite charming just the way you are.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:50.570
Please stay this way,
and just do the best you can.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:52.290
Yes, Father.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:56.510
Don't take them off unless you're in really big trouble.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:57.120
Yes, Sir.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.250
Yes, yes...

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.130
Damn it all to hell!

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.200
Darling!

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:03.630
What are you doing?

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:06.550
Nothing. Stay out.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.840
Dinner's ready.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.100
Don't want any.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:13.030
Why not? I even helped make some of it...

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.880
Argh, damn it...

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.940
What's this?

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.300
Darling?

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:28.450
So, Iwaki-kun has finally reached the final showdown!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.220
"The final showdown"?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:33.960
He's going to propose to Sensei
while she's sick and vulnerable!

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.710
So what happens then?

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:38.140
It's bad, very bad!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.370
Sensei might be
vulnerable enough to say yes!

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.200
And then he'll dump you and elope with her!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.170
No way!

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:47.220
So you'd better stick close to him,
no matter what!

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:49.500
Don't let yourselves get
separated for any reason!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.260
Okay.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.480
All right!

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:53.280
Leave this to your Papas.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.230
Thank you, Papas!

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.150
Rizel, it's here!

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:24.230
The German-made Absolutely Unbreakable Chain Collar!

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.680
Softly, quietly...

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:33.060
Darling isn't awake yet...

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:36.980
On tag:
"Made by Papa C"

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:39.900
That's not my husband!

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:41.850
We're sorry, Rizel!

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:44.070
We took too long negotiating
a transport route

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:47.400
through various countries'
territorial airspaces...

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.690
Darling...

00:08:58.190 --> 00:08:59.620
Iwaki-kun!

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.460
Do you have a moment?

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:05.090
Sensei, I have something I want to show you...

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:06.130
Like what?

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:07.300
Come with me and you'll see.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.610
B-But...

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:10.400
You're not really sick, are you?

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.890
Anyway, just come with me.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:14.730
W-Wait, stop!

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:19.560
What?! Really?!

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:20.870
Yeah...

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:25.180
He's still a no-show. And so is Sensei...

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:27.990
Ehh? Then they're going to elope?!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:29.550
You have to go after them!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:32.450
Rizel-chan, you love Iwaki-kun, don't you?

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:37.320
If you love him, you have to go!
You know all the places he frequents!

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.370
Yeah!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.440
What about school?

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:46.340
Iwaki-kun!

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.130
Where are we going?!

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.690
This place is amazing!

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:09.410
Ever since I was a little kid,
I'd come here whenever I was feeling down.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.070
Like when I'd had a fight with someone...

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:16.370
I thought so.  So you <i>did</i>  see it.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:21.770
And those flowers were also from you? Thank you.

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:24.040
They were just a... get-well gift.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.090
They got me well.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.950
He's the worst!

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:37.610
A guy who would make his fiancﾃｩe cry is...

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:39.950
You're right.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.440
He doesn't understand you at all, Sensei.

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:44.530
No...

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.320
If he did, he could never do
something like that.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.280
He's the worst!

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:51.390
That's right, the worst!

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.100
Should I just yell it out?

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:56.030
"You're the worst!"

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:57.980
Y-Yeah!

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:02.920
YOU'RE THE WORST!
YOU'RE THE WORST!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.920
W-We're kind of... hitting it off pretty well...

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:16.250
Maybe, just maybe...

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:17.780
...we really...

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:21.190
Thank you, Iwaki-kun! I feel much better!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:25.460
After all, tomorrow is another day!

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:30.750
You could say we both took everything the wrong way.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.600
R-Really?

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:36.310
But thanks to you, Iwaki-kun,
I was able to get over it in one day.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:38.250
Kind of simple-minded...

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.110
You see, when you become an adult...

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:44.920
...there'll be times when wanting
to understand someone will drive you to tears.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.500
Iwaki-kun,

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:54.230
thank you so much for today!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.020
What was that about? Damn it...

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:09.570
I've found you, Darling!

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:19.000
Darling...

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:24.970
I will always be here for you...

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:27.450
What're you talking about, Rizel?

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:30.070
Your chest is as flat as your brain is dull.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.020
No...!

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:11.810
Darling? Huh? He's not here...

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:13.690
Oh, long time no see!

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:17.720
Eh? What's newlywed life like?
He gets all angry every day.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:19.820
I found out what my husband's
favorite food is, too!

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:21.290
Well, I'm in a hurry, so...

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.830
Darling, where are you?!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.780
Darling? Darling! Eh? He's not here...

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:33.430
Oh, long time no see!
Eh? What's newlywed life like?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:37.590
It's really fun, and he gets
all angry at me every day, too!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:40.150
I found out what my husband's
favorite food is, too!

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:44.780
Keep this a secret, but he'll eat anything, whether he likes it or not!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.390
Well, he <i>says</i>  it's because he just hasn't made up his mind yet, but...

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:50.060
Well, I'm in a hurry, so...

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:53.450
Darling! Darling, where are you?
